@startuml R3_Protocol_V0_Sequence
' Participants
box "Retail User" #lightgrey
actor "Retail User\n(browser/wallet)" as User
end box

box "R3 Vault WebPortal" #lavender
participant "R3 Vault\n(WebPortal)" as R3VaultWeb
end box

box "Solana / Blockchain" #lightblue
participant "Solana Wallet\n(Generated / Persistent)" as Wallet
participant "Anchor Vault Program\n(On-chain Vault)" as Vault
participant "Token-2022 Program\n(R3 Shares mint/burn)" as Token2022
end box

participant "KYC\n(Web SDK + Webhook)" as KYC


participant "Jupiter\n(Swap Aggregator)" as Jupiter
participant "Fuul Points API\n(/api/fuul/points)" as Fuul
' == Setup ==
' User -> Wallet: Deposit of USDC

' == User Registration & KYC (optional)==
' note across: TODO 

' == R3 Vault Portal Login ==
' User -> R3VaultWeb : Login (TODO)
' R3VaultWeb -> User : Authenticated session

== Deposit of USDC ==
User -> R3VaultWeb: Clicks Deposit of USDC (10 USDC)
R3VaultWeb -> R3VaultWeb: create TX data
R3VaultWeb -> User: sends unsigned TX data
note over User #pink
Tampering attack, including non 
serializable data passed to oracle
end note 
User -> User: signs TX data
User -> Vault: submits signed TX data
activate Vault
note over Vault #LightGreen
 declares TX accessed accounts (READ/WRITE ones)
  to avoid concurrency issues:
  - Vault USDC Balance (WRITE)
  ... (TODO complete list)
end note
Vault -> Vault: Start ATOMIC TX
Vault -> Jupiter: Call Oracles, swaps etc (TODO)
Jupiter -> Vault: Return swap/oracle data (TODO)
Vault -> Vault: Calculate new User shares comparing to \ninitial state and final state of the Vault balance\n(8.3 R3 Shares)
alt calculation verification success
Vault -> Token2022: Mint 8.3 R3 Shares to User Wallet
else verification failure
Vault -> Vault: Abort TX \n(Revert state to initial)
end
deactivate Vault


note over R3VaultWeb,User: Who notifies success (polling or webhook)
R3VaultWeb -> User: update Balance \n(Credit User Account 8.3 R3 Shares)

== Withdrawal of R3 Shares ==

User -> R3VaultWeb: Clicks Withdraw of R3 Shares (8.3 R3 Shares)
User -> User: Sign withdrawal TX data
User -> Vault: submits signed withdrawal TX data
activate Vault
note over Vault #LightGreen
 declares TX accessed accounts (READ/WRITE ones)
  to avoid concurrency issues:
  - Vault USDC Balance (WRITE)
  ... (TODO complete list)
end note
Vault -> Vault: Start ATOMIC TX
Vault -> Token2022: Burn 8.3 R3 Shares from User Wallet
Vault -> Jupiter: Call Oracles, swaps etc (TODO)
Vault -> Vault: Calculate new Vault USDC balance comparing to \ninitial state and final state of the Vault USDC balance\n(+10 USDC)
note over Vault #LightGreen
 Verify Vault USDC balance updated correctly\n to avoid tampering exploitations
end note
alt verification success
Vault -> Vault: Transfer USDC to User Wallet
else verification failure
Vault -> Vault: Abort TX \n(Revert state to initial)
end
deactivate Vault
@enduml
